{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30642","headline":"送费[链]师供奉赴上都 · 姚鹄","name":"送费[链]师供奉赴上都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缩地周游不计程，古今应只有先生。\n已同化鹤临华表，又见骖龙向玉清。\n萝磴静攀云共过，雪坛当醮月孤明。\n无因相逐朝天帝，空羡烟霞得送迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}